WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.270
Brought to you by Guodong Subs

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.360
We do not own the copyright. Only for academic exchange purpose.
Welcome to watch it on the official channel

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:24.860
Pass through boundaries of life and death, stride over the peak of the sky

00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:32.060
Look at this dim dark sky from the distance

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.190
Glowing tears on fair skin

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:47.930
Melt this dark night

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:52.730
Souls entwine both on watch

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:58.460
Protect the candle-like warmth

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.700
Under the night sky sunflowers are swaying in the wind

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:06.390
As the night will always pass by

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:11.260
Let's embrace the new dawn

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.990
Fleeting Meteor

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:18.300
Broke the silence of the sky

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:22.730
Call for new heroes with my remaining brightness

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:25.260
Burn out the flame of life in the wind

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.590
Penetrate the endless horizon

00:01:27.590 --> 00:01:29.930
Cross over the long night to another end

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.990
Search for that destination

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.660
Fly towards the other side of my dream

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:42.360
Episode 14

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:46.400
20 years ago

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.400
In order to get a snake spirit’s core

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:52.130
I tracked it to a village known as Xi Di

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:57.400
What I didn’t expect was also finding something else

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:06.930
strange monster girl

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:09.400
Hit her, hit her

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.600
strange monster girl, hit her, hit her

00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:16.930
A six year-old

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.930
who has already reached the Late-Stage of Qi Condensation.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:23.800
She has a body which has been able to self-cultivate since birth

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:26.830
This is a rare super spirit root

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.130
I’ll get her

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.330
and use her to remedy my terrible intelligence

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:37.330
He's so accurate, it's awesome

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:42.260
Little friend, stay here a moment

00:02:45.860 --> 00:02:48.530
But she unexpected refused me

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:52.930
So, in order to get her

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:56.400
I massacred her entire while village disguised as the snake spirit

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:01.600
And used a magical grass which can make yaoguai go crazy

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:04.000
To make that snake spirit get lost itself

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:09.400
The girl thought it had killed all those people but couldn’t take revenge

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:14.460
So she asked for my help in killing the snake spirit

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:21.200
The cost was to follow me and cultivate under my education

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:26.530
Not only did I get you, a nourishing super spirit root

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:32.460
I also got the core of that snake spirit

00:03:34.660 --> 00:03:35.800
My dear Ruyue

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.260
Hearing this story

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.530
How does it make you feel?

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:47.730
Little snake, little snake

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.860
You evil monster

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.260
I’ll kill you

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:57.200
Ruyue

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:01.660
Muzi, I’ll chase her, it’s too dangerous for her to fight alone

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:02.930
Yingxiong

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:07.330
It seems that'll be the only way

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:11.800
Go to hell!

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:30.260
You are still so naïve

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:33.730
Controlling Art

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:52.060
You kid, you hid the weapon behind Ruyue

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.730
You are just as insidious as I am.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.330
Ling Er, come back

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:02.330
Ruyue is emotionally impulsive, so she easily fell for your trap

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.800
But you're overconfident

00:05:05.600 --> 00:05:07.260
You think everything is under your control

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:08.660
You deserve to be hurt

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:18.660
Kid

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:21.860
I'll tear you to pieces

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:23.930
Controlling Art

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.260
To fool me with such low art,

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:36.600
I’ll show you a real Controlling Art

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.260
Come here

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.170
Butler

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.040
1982’s Lafite is terrible for rinsing one's mouth

00:06:04.310 --> 00:06:05.770
I need a 1970's next time

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:07.040
Yes, young master

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.710
Butler, what’s going on?

00:06:23.710 --> 00:06:26.040
Is someone blocking the road?

00:06:27.310 --> 00:06:29.910
Young master, no one would block an airplane

00:06:35.570 --> 00:06:36.710
Something terrible happened, young master

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:39.240
I lost control of the airplane, it's gonna crash soon

00:06:40.440 --> 00:06:42.170
It will crash in about 2 minutes

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:44.240
I’ll leave first if you don’t mind

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:47.240
I won't be in need of this month’s salary

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.510
Are you kidding me, where's my parachute?

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:01.840
Not good, young master

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.840
Our young master must leave first

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:34.770
This kind of power

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.110
Could it be…

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:42.840
I’m still a virgin, I don’t wanna die

00:07:45.370 --> 00:07:45.770
Butler

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:47.640
Am I hallucinating?

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:49.840
I saw a girl fly by

00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.640
Young master, I can’t see anything

00:08:05.110 --> 00:08:06.770
This is the real Heaven's Punishment

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:07.970
Start

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.910
My Foundation Establishment Heaven's Punishment

00:08:44.110 --> 00:08:45.370
This will smash you into flesh and mud

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.770
I finally can use part of the ability of my Dark Sky

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.510
Is this…

00:08:52.910 --> 00:08:53.970
Heaven's Punishment?

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:56.170
I have to rely on the power of the thunder from the Punishment

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:57.710
To kill this monster

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:02.040
Passing the Heaven's Punishment while fighting?

00:09:02.570 --> 00:09:04.040
The thunder is even being absorbed by her

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.640
Could she be the rare thunder spirit root?

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.910
I'm lucky, that you're just in Foundation Establishment

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.740
Or I’d have to escape

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:15.440
Muzi

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:16.170
You're…

00:09:21.310 --> 00:09:22.570
Go to hell, old monster

00:09:22.570 --> 00:09:25.770
But even if I can absorb just you, the thunder spirit root of Foundation Establishment

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:30.640
I will reach the Late-Stage of Core Formation

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:48.570
Muzi

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:10.570
Old monster, I have to thank you for helping me pass my Heaven's Punishment

00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.970
Little girl

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:23.110
Go die

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:25.110
Muzi, watch out!!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:30.310
Yingxiong, stay back

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:47.510
Muzi

00:10:57.640 --> 00:11:01.240
No

00:11:05.040 --> 00:11:05.440
This is

00:11:05.970 --> 00:11:06.770
the charm Muzi gave me

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.570
Even with all your various ways of staying alive,

00:11:09.840 --> 00:11:11.910
I will still kill you

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:17.640
Muzi

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.440
Lend me your power

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:21.710
Old monster

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.370
Open your eyes and just look

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:24.710
This is

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.040
My Heaven's Punishment Girlfriend

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:43.940
It's the whisper of waves
Waken at nightfall

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:49.740
The scenery outside the window is dyed red by the afterglow

00:11:51.070 --> 00:11:58.140
Blank mood
Scattered time

00:11:58.140 --> 00:12:02.880
No one is along with me to the dawn time

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:11.210
Ear is listening
Wind is passed

00:12:11.210 --> 00:12:16.740
Could I hear the sound of your heart beat?

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:24.740
Let this wind blows hair to the air

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:31.540
Bit bit drops into my heart
Pitter-patter is perpetual

00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:38.540
Rose in the vase rises her white body sideways

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:43.680
It rejects of dying alone
